{
  "sequence_id": "seq_4833e23eec54344b",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Sugisawa Hospital."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "knock knock"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "ITADORI ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "How is IGuchi doing?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The doctors say he's fine, but ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...he's still uncommon- scious."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's all my fault."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's because I told him to come to school that night..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Plip plip"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You probably won't believe me..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...but we were attacked by a strange monster..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...and I was captured too."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I believe you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "those weren't monsters. They were curses."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "That finger is something called a special- grade cursed object."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It was able to gather causes and make itself stronger."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "ITA- DORI?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "So it's not your fault."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'm the one who picked it up in the first place."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'm sorry, but don't worry."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "There's someone coming tomorrow who can help iguchi."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'm sorry, sasaki."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "There's somewhere I need to go."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'll see ya later."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Who passed away?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "My grandpa. But I guess he's more like a dad."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I see. Sorry to bother you at a time like this."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "So, have you made a decision?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Are there a lot of casualties with curses like this?"
    }
  ],
